### 목록 조회
GET {{host}}/api/posts

### 목록 조회 - 페이지네이션
GET {{host}}/api/posts?page=2&limit=5

### 없는 글 조회 (404)
GET {{host}}/api/posts/000000000000000000000000

### 잘못된 형식 id (400)
GET {{host}}/api/posts/abc

### 글 작성
POST {{host}}/api/posts
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{ "title": "1 글", "content": "내용입니다" }

### 회원가입 테스트
POST {{host}}/api/auth/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": "user",
  "pw": "user@1234",
  "name": "일반계정"
}

### 로그인 실패 (401)
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "id": "test", "pw": "wrongpass" }

### 로그인 — 토큰 저장
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "id": "test", "pw": "test@1234" }

> {%
    client.global.set("token", response.body.data.token);
%}

### 내 정보
GET {{host}}/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 글 수정 (제목만)
PATCH {{host}}/api/posts/6a952fababdbc5705e93f2b6
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{ "title": "수정된 제목" }

### 글 수정 - 없는 id (404)
PATCH {{host}}/api/posts/000000000000000000000000
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title": "안 될 것" }

### 글 삭제
DELETE {{host}}/api/posts/6a9613c950f276ee6592f9ab
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 댓글 작성
POST {{host}}/api/posts/6a952fd8abdbc5705e93f2bc/comments
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{ "content": "첫 댓글" }

### 댓글 목록
GET {{host}}/api/posts/6a952fe9abdbc5705e93f2bf/comments

### 댓글 수정
PATCH {{host}}/api/comments/6a952fe9abdbc5705e93f2bf
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{ "content": "수정된 댓글" }

### 댓글 삭제
DELETE {{host}}/api/comments/6a952fe9abdbc5705e93f2bf
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}